  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_NAME_0
    value: WILD X2
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_DESCRIPTION_0
    value: 'Substitutes for all symbols

      except         .


      If less than
      3 Wild X2 are part of any win combination, each Wild X2 doubles up the line
      pay.'
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_NAME_1
    value: BONUS
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_DESCRIPTION_1
    value: 3         anywhere on reels triggers <color=yellow>Money Trail Bonus</color>.
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_NAME_2
    value: MIXED BARS
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_0
    value: <style=title><size=32>WILD</style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_1
    value: <style=title><size=32>SUB-SYMBOL</style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_2
    value: '<style=title><size=32>JACKPOT

      </style>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_3
    value: <style=title><size=32>RE-SPIN FEATURE</style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_4
    value: <style=title><size=32>MIGHTY WHEELS BONUS</style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_0
    value: Appears on all reels and substitutes for all symbols.
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_1
    value: "- <color=yellow>Sub-Symbol</color> is one of the following multipliers:
      X2,\n   X3, X4 or X5.\n- Sub-Symbols can appear with any symbol except \n 
      Wilds.\n- If Symbols with Sub-Symbols are part of win line(s),\n  then Sub-Symbols
      get multiplied to each other and \n  applied to the win(s)."
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_2
    value: '- 3                          awards

      - 2                         
      and a                        awards

      - A                          and
      2                        awards

      - 3                          awards'
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_3
    value: "- Any 2 Wilds on reels triggers a <color=yellow>Re-Spin Feature</color>
      . \n- The reel without Wild does a Re-Spin.\n- Before Re-Spin Feature, award
      line wins, if any.\n- From Re-Spin Feature, if Wild appears, then award\n  
      relevant Jackpot.\n- Re-Spin Feature awards Jackpot only, not line wins."
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_4
    value: '- In any spin,             can appear anywhere on reels as a Sub-Symbol.

      -
      Collection of 10 Sub-Symbols triggers Mighty Wheels Bonus.

      - With 2
      more unlocked Wheels, player can win Free Games as well as a multiplier for
      the Coin Prize.'
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_PAYOUT_FORMAT
    value: <b><size=35><style=coinColor>{0:CommaNumber}</style></size></b>
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_PAYOUT_ANY_SEVENS
    value: <b><size=35> <style=coinColor>10</style></size></b>
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_PAYOUT_ANY_BARS
    value: <b><size=35> <style=coinColor>3</style></size></b>
